{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend the mountain, scavenge what you can, and upgrade your gear to push forward. Carve a path through the mountain pass and uncover the truth buried beneath wind, stone, and silence. No timers, no pressure\u2014just you and the mountain. Conquer the terrain, and in doing so, conquer yourself.<br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Solo Exploration:</strong> Experience a meditative, pressure-free journey through a mysterious mountain landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Resourceful Progression:</strong> Sell wood for cold, hard cash. Scavenge relics of the past to upgrade your tools and reach new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Uncover the Truth:</strong> Follow the whispers of legend to piece together the fate of Captain Elias and the treasure he died to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Atmospheric World:</strong> Explore a rich, quiet world shaped by time, weather, and forgotten stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cost less than a burrito. Go ahead, hit a couple trees and see what happens.</strong>\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750460/extras/c1ee9bd1aa6d4b11d140a07ea83e3f2c.poster.avif?t=1757073552\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750460/extras/c1ee9bd1aa6d4b11d140a07ea83e3f2c.webm?t=1757073552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750460/extras/c1ee9bd1aa6d4b11d140a07ea83e3f2c.mp4?t=1757073552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.